# Package manifest for the minimal reference build.
#
# This is an allowlist. Adding a package requires:
#   1. review against docs/policy/authorized-use.md;
#   2. a license/export review per docs/policy/legal-licensing-export.md;
#   3. a recorded version in the release manifest; and
#   4. tests/all.sh passing.
#
# Desktop and panel packages come from the maria-padilha-de build. They are
# intentionally not duplicated here; this manifest is the base + installer +
# security scope only.

# Arch base
base
linux
linux-firmware
intel-ucode
amd-ucode
mkinitcpio
sudo
networkmanager
iwd
openssh
git
gnupg
vim
nano
less
man-db
pacman-contrib
archlinux-keyring

# BlackArch package trust and mirror configuration
blackarch-keyring
blackarch-mirrorlist

# Installer
calamares

# Reviewed security tools: network analysis, forensics, isolated lab
nmap
wireshark-qt
sleuthkit
qemu-desktop
libvirt
virt-manager
edk2-ovmf
firejail

# Explicitly not included in the reference build:
#   set, gophish, evilginx, mimikatz, lazagne, responder, and any other
#   phishing-template or credential-theft package. See the denylist in
#   denylist.txt and the policy review in docs/policy/authorized-use.md.
